# ==============================================================================
# BASE CONFIGURATION: OpenRouter (Default)
# ==============================================================================
# OpenRouter is the default provider. It offers free and paid models with
# 50 free requests per day per account (or credit-based billing for paid models).
# Get your API key at: https://openrouter.ai/
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your_openrouter_api_key_here

# Default model:
OPENROUTER_MODEL=inclusionai/ling-3.0-flash-sante:free

# Default OpenRouter API endpoint:
# OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1

# Multi-Key Rotation (Optional):
# You can also place multiple OpenRouter keys in `API_KEYS_OPEN_ROUTER.txt`
# (one key per line). The agent will automatically failover to the next key
# upon hitting 429 rate limits or daily quota exhaustion.


# ==============================================================================
# ALTERNATIVE PROVIDERS (OpenAI-Compatible Endpoints)
# ==============================================================================
# You can use any OpenAI-compatible API by setting OPENROUTER_BASE_URL,
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY, and OPENROUTER_MODEL. Each provider has different
# rate limits and quota structures:

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Google AI Studio (Gemini)
# Limits: Generous free tier with ~15 RPM (Requests/Min) and 1,500 RPD (Requests/Day).
# Multi-Key Rotation: Place multiple keys in `API_KEYS_GEMINI.txt` for automatic failover.
# Get your key at: https://aistudio.google.com/
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai/
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=AIzaSy...your_gemini_api_key_here
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=gemini-1.5-flash

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Groq
# Limits: Free tier with high speed, bounded by Tokens-Per-Minute (TPM) and RPM.
# Multi-Key Rotation: Place multiple keys in `API_KEYS_GROQ.txt` for automatic failover.
# Get your key at: https://console.groq.com/
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=gsk_...your_groq_api_key_here
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. DeepSeek Direct
# Limits: Pay-as-you-go balance / token-based pricing.
# Get your key at: https://platform.deepseek.com/
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com/v1
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-...your_deepseek_api_key_here
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=deepseek-chat

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. OpenAI Direct
# Limits: Tiered usage quotas and rate limits based on account balance.
# Get your key at: https://platform.openai.com/
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-...your_openai_api_key_here
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Local Ollama (Zero API Keys, 100% Offline)
# Limits: Unlimited requests, zero cost, runs on your own hardware.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=qwen2.5-coder:1.5b
# (Alternatively, simply pass --local when running the agent)


# ==============================================================================
# WORKSPACE & SANDBOX CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================================
# Workspace root directory for file operations (defaults to current project directory)
# AI_AGENT_WORKSPACE=.
